<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - CANTV started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CANTV started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Credit Lyonnais Securities said analyst Matheus Tarzia has started coverage of Venezuelan telephone company Compaa Annima Nacional Telfonos de Venezuela, or CANTV, with a rating of buy.</p>
<p>-- In a March 11 report, Tarzia said in part, &quot;Improved operational efficiency and increasing revenues should expand EBITDA margins by 26 percent over the next three years.&quot;</p>
<p>-- He set a 12-month price target for CANTV's American Depositary Receipts of $37.</p>
<p>-- CANTV ADRs rose 1-5/8 to 28-7/8.</p>
<p>((-- Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk 212 859-1879))</p>
</text>
